1. Copyright holders
   This repository (the "Work") is jointly owned by:
   - Tech: KimMinUng (GitHub @kimminung)
   - Design: iMasterProX (GitHub @iMasterProX)

2. Scope
   The Work includes the source code, build settings, design deliverables (kart models, textures,
   thumbnails and silhouettes — including those brought over from RetireX Online — and the colour
   system, track tile models and textures, icons, onboarding illustrations, mockups, style guide,
   replacement textures, the seven self-synthesized sound effects, the three background music tracks
     (`Assets/bgm/`, `KartSimulator/Resources/BGM/` — composed by iMasterProX for the "RetireX Online
     Soundtrack", and their conversions), generator scripts), documentation,
   track definitions, the app name "Pinch Rover" (and the former working title "Pinch Kart") and its
   screen/interaction design — except the
   third-party components listed in Section 5.

3. Permitted
   - Viewing the repository on GitHub, and cloning, building and running it locally for personal
     study or evaluation.
   - Forking within GitHub's Terms of Service for the sole purpose of preparing a Pull Request to the
     copyright holders.
   All other rights are reserved.

4. Prohibited without prior written permission from BOTH copyright holders
   - Commercial use of any kind (sale, paid distribution, advertising revenue, service offering,
     app store publication).
   - Redistribution, publication or hosting of the Work or any part of it, modified or not
     (other than the fork/Pull Request case above).
   - Derivative works: other apps, games, asset packs, fonts, sound packs or design systems based on
     the Work.
   - Standalone use of any design asset (karts, tracks, icons, illustrations, sounds, palette) apart
     from the Work.
   - Use as training or fine-tuning data for machine learning, or inclusion in such datasets.
   - Removing or altering copyright notices or this license.
   - Using the names of the copyright holders or "Pinch Rover" for endorsement or promotion.

5. Third-party components (not covered by this license; their own terms apply)
   - Galmuri font — Copyright (c) 2019–2025 Lee Minseo (quiple), SIL Open Font License 1.1 (`Design/fonts/OFL.txt`,
     also bundled at `KartSimulator/Resources/Fonts/OFL.txt`; credited in the app menu).
   - Five engine sounds (`engine*.wav`, preview `Design/audio/engine_preview.wav`) — converted from the
     "XK ENGINE 3.0.0" add-on WAVs by CYBOX DIGITAL ENTERTAINMENT (used by RetireX Online), confirmed by the
     operator to be based on CC0 recordings; provenance and SHA-256 in `Assets/sfx/LICENSES.md` Section 2.
   - RetireX Online reference material (`Design/reference/retirex/`) — reference only. Minecraft
     elements visible in those renders belong to Mojang/Microsoft and are not part of the Work.
   - Apple platform SDKs and frameworks and the SF Pro system fonts — Apple developer license terms;
     not included in this repository.
   - Minimap base model `KartSimulator/Resources/Minimap/Diorama_Base.usdz` — from Apple's "Diorama" sample
     code, under the Apple Sample Code License (`LICENSE-Apple-Diorama-Sample.txt` in the same folder). Used
     only as part of this app; not redistributed standalone or repackaged; Apple's names and trademarks are not
     used to promote this Work.

